==English==
{{wikipedia}}
[[File:Sierraleone w2 locator.svg|thumb|right|Sierra Leone]]

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|it|sierra||mountain range}} + {{m|it|leone||lion}} (via [[Venetian]]), itself from {{der|en|pt|Serra Leoa||lioness mountains}}, as the area was described to the rest of Europe by Venetian explorer {{w|Alvise Cadamosto}}; in reference to the {{w|Lion Mountains}} (named by {{w|Pedro de Sintra}} in 1462).

